   <logo>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MagSec-fur/GLPI_knowlegde_base_number_plugin/main/knowledgeautonumber/pics/icon.png</logo>
   <description>
      <short>
         <en>Gives every knowledge base article a unique, permanent number (KI-0001, KI-0002, ...).</en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>Gives every GLPI knowledge base article a unique, permanent number (KI-0001, KI-0002, ...) when it is created.
Numbers never change, are never reused, and are shown in the article, in its form and in the search engine.
A console command numbers articles created while the plugin was disabled.</en>
      </long>
   </description>
